    "text": "somewhere along the way, many of us learned to leave parts of ourselves behind just to make it through.\n\nhealing is not becoming someone new. it is returning— to the self that was always there, waiting beneath the noise.\n\na quiet reflection with @gabormatemd  for anyone learning how to come home to themselves.\n\nif this found you at the right moment, save it. \nsend it to someone walking their way back.",
